A phase listed before a phase it waits on. app waits on base (listed after
it) and on tail (not listed, so it comes after every listed phase). x and y
wait on each other, so their order is free.

-- ajiya.toml --
[project]
name = "Fixture"
prefix = "FX"

[phases]
order = ["app", "base", "y", "x"]
