-- want --
W011 ajiya.toml: phase app is listed before phase base, which it waits on: FX-0002 depends on FX-0001. Fix: ajiya phase move base --before app, or 'ajiya phase order --apply'
W011 ajiya.toml: phase app is listed, so it comes before phase tail, which it waits on: FX-0002 depends on FX-0006. Fix: ajiya phase move tail --before app, or 'ajiya phase order --apply'
